顔ばっか\n送ってくるw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったっくん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(⌒‐⌒)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまた更新します♪ノシ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノシノシのし"}],"source":"archive"}